00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:10.760
But I was just reminded today, as we get going,

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:13.760
I just quickly wanted to throw this out.

00:13:13.760 --> 00:13:16.760
I don't know what traditions you guys have come from,

00:13:16.760 --> 00:13:20.760
but for me, I've always been a part of kind of a non-denominational,

00:13:20.760 --> 00:13:23.760
evangelical-type tradition.

00:13:23.760 --> 00:13:27.760
And I've been in either in the audience or on stage

00:13:27.760 --> 00:13:34.760
for some very big, large, extravagant smoke-and-lights worship settings

00:13:34.760 --> 00:13:37.760
that have been very powerful in moments.

00:13:37.760 --> 00:13:40.760
So I'm not speaking down to those at all.

00:13:40.760 --> 00:13:42.760
And then I've been a part of very quaint, small,

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:46.760
just a few people in a room with a guitar settings

00:13:46.760 --> 00:13:49.760
that have also been very powerful.

00:13:49.760 --> 00:13:52.760
And today, right before I came up on this stage,

00:13:52.760 --> 00:13:56.760
I was unseating a toilet and putting on a new toilet.

00:13:56.760 --> 00:13:59.760
And do you know what might have been the most worshipful thing I experienced?

00:13:59.760 --> 00:14:03.760
It was my dad giving up his Sunday afternoon nap to come

00:14:03.760 --> 00:14:07.760
and literally put his hand down in our nasty,

00:14:07.760 --> 00:14:11.760
insert whatever word you want, toilets,

00:14:11.760 --> 00:14:13.760
to put on a new one.

00:14:13.760 --> 00:14:18.760
And it was just this reminder to me that worship is not the room that we're in

00:14:18.760 --> 00:14:20.760
and it's not the music that we sing,

00:14:20.760 --> 00:14:22.760
but it is the way that we have lived our lives.

00:14:22.760 --> 00:14:24.760
It's the way that we interact with one another.

00:14:24.760 --> 00:14:28.760
It's the love that we share with God and each other.

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:32.760
So regardless of our setting or how big or small the band,

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:35.760
how quality or unquality the music,

00:14:35.760 --> 00:14:38.760
our worship is what we do with it.

00:14:38.760 --> 00:14:43.760
And so I pray that today we will enter in with whatever's going on in our life

00:14:43.760 --> 00:14:45.760
and find God right there in the midst of it,

00:14:45.760 --> 00:14:46.760
because He is.

00:14:46.760 --> 00:14:48.760
He is right there waiting for us.

00:14:48.760 --> 00:14:50.760
So you guys are welcome.

00:14:50.760 --> 00:14:53.760
With all of our stuff, we're all welcome to this space.

00:14:53.760 --> 00:14:56.760
So let's enter into it together.

